  - #642 Move name validation (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/642=20
  - #640 Use the DTLS ClientHello structure in ECH with DTLS (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/640=20
  - #638 Move name validation to the authentication section (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/638=20
  - #637 Issue628 dns names (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/637=20
  - #636 Invalid names end in .invalid. Fixes #630 (6 by 0x9fff00, bemasc, =
ekr, martinthomson)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/636=20

  2 pull requests merged:
  - Use the DTLS ClientHello structure in ECH with DTLS
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/640=20
  - Clarify that DTLS uses the DTLS HKDF-Expand-Label
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/641=20

* tlswg/sslkeylogfile (+1/-1/=F0=9F=92=AC2)
  1 pull requests submitted:
  - We can recommend conditional compilation (by martinthomson)
    https://github.com/tlswg/sslkeylogfile/pull/23=20

  2 pull requests received 2 new comments:
  - #23 We can recommend conditional compilation (1 by yaroslavros)
    https://github.com/tlswg/sslkeylogfile/pull/23=20
  - #22 Fix typo for EARLY_EXPORTER_SECRET label (1 by martinthomson)
    https://github.com/tlswg/sslkeylogfile/pull/22=20

  1 pull requests merged:
  - Fix typo for EARLY_EXPORTER_SECRET label
    https://github.com/tlswg/sslkeylogfile/pull/22=20

* tlswg/tls13-spec (+5/-5/=F0=9F=92=AC3)
  5 pull requests submitted:
  - Update contributors list (by loganaden)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1376=20
  - Fix redundant word. (by loganaden)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1374=20
  - Suggest getrandom interface which is available on newer OSes. (by logan=
aden)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1373=20
  - Clarify the use of HKDF-Expand-Label. (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1372=20
  - Rpk misbinding (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1371=20

  2 pull requests received 3 new comments:
  - #1369 Editorial updates to references (2 by ekr, emanjon)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1369=20
  - #1366 Appendix on RPK misbinding attacks (1 by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1366=20

  5 pull requests merged:
  - Editorial updates to references
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1369=20
  - Appendix on RPK misbinding attacks
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1366=20
  - Rpk misbinding
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1371=20
  - More generic recommendation for CSPRNG.
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1375=20
  - Remove normative references to paywalled crypto
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1370=20


